Binary authenticity: every genuine build embeds the provenance depth
matrix and prints `status=verified` plus a `b3:` blake3 anchor on its
`Depth-matrix:` line — verify with `cosmostrix -V`, or run the
stronger `cosmostrix sig` (four-depth report ending
`SIGNATURE: AUTHENTIC (4/4 depths verified)`; exit code 2 means the
binary was modified after compilation). Mechanism and honest limits
are documented once in docs/INNOVATIONS.md (entry 31).

